        {
          "itemCode": "ACTSQ_02",
          "content": "…在心里与令人不愉快的感受、想法或身体感觉拉开更多距离，观察它们，而不是陷入其中。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "actsq_applicability_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ACTSQ_03",
          "content": "…把注意力放在此时此地（当下），而不是放在自己的未来和过去。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "actsq_applicability_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ACTSQ_04",
          "content": "…认识到我的感受、想法和身体感觉是我的一部分，但我不仅仅是这些感受、想法和身体感觉。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "actsq_applicability_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ACTSQ_05",
          "content": "…看清生活中什么对我重要，以及什么为我的生活指明方向。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "actsq_applicability_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ACTSQ_06",
          "content": "…在日常生活中，按照那些对我重要、并为我的生活指明方向的事来行动。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "actsq_applicability_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
